        "original_id": "412b1114-dff4-5e17-b710-3a153fd0e2b8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roddy Maude-Roxby, Tom McGowan, Tom Rowe, Clint Eastwood\n- Films: The Aristocats, Unconditional Love, White Hunter Black Heart\n- Companies: Walt Disney\n- Characters: Edgar Balthazar, Thompson\n- Topics: Disney animated feature films, film plots\n\nFacts:\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby was born on 2 April 1930 in London.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby is an English actor.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby appeared as Edgar Balthazar in Walt Disney's film The Aristocats.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby appeared in the film Unconditional Love.\n- Roddy Maude-Roxby played Thompson in Clint Eastwood's film White Hunter Black Heart.\n- The Aristocats is the 20th Disney animated feature film.\n- The Aristocats is based on a story by Tom McGowan and Tom Rowe.\n- The Aristocats revolves around a family of aristocratic cats.\n- In The Aristocats, an alley cat helps the aristocratic cat family after a butler kidnaps them to gain his mistress's fortune, which was intended to go to the cats.",
